{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026j0hfMWBesG1795043000.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券，與本港收市比較，造價普遍向下。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合132.83元，比本港收市低3.17元。工商銀行7.89元，低5仙。建設銀行10.52元，高1仙。友邦保險76.2元，低0.65元。港交所370.99元，低4.61元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股361.89元，低10.91元。阿里巴巴82.74元，低2.51元。理想汽車45.13元，低0.41元。金沙中國10.27元，低0.12元。長和67.62元，低0.98元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:04:18.342239+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:14.079177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T23:57:35.939921+00:00","content_hash":"83da47464fac6763fd68dece189bfe531eb7b3e74289ae34e1b6c0439de1b2b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:04:18.342239+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}